# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Database
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NEON_DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:password@ep-xxx.eu-west-1.aws.neon.tech/applymind?sslmode=require


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# File storage — CV and cover letter uploads
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
APPLYMIND_CV_BUCKET=your-real-or-test-bucket-name


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AI job-match scoring (GPT-4o-mini)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
OPENAI_API_KEY=my-open-ai-key


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Server
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
PORT=8080

# Every origin allowed to call this API with credentials (cookies) attached.
# Comma-separated, no trailing slashes, no wildcards — the session cookie
# depends on an exact match here, not a pattern.
#
# Both dashboard deployments need an entry: the real app, where sign-in
# actually happens, and the portfolio showcase, whose reads go through with
# the seeded demo account's token rather than a cookie but still originate
# from its own domain. Add your local dev port too, or nothing on
# localhost:3000 will be able to reach this API at all.
CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,https://applymind.dev,https://applymind.faroukhasnaoui.tech


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# APPLYMIND_API_KEY — status unconfirmed, see note below
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This was the shared static-key credential from before phases 14/15 replaced
# it with per-user sessions and API tokens (see internal/auth/model.go —
# CredentialSession and CredentialToken are the only two kinds now; there is
# no CredentialAPIKey). If nothing in the Go code reads this var anymore, it
# should be deleted from here entirely rather than left as something that
# looks configurable but silently does nothing.
# APPLYMIND_API_KEY=some-local-dev-key